==Strategy==
==='''Chapter 1 '''===
Use 3-4 meatshields with [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut]] and tanky attackers (like [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Mythical Titan Cat]]) against the Shadow Boxer Ks. [[:Category:Anti-Dark Cats|Anti-Dark Cats]] such as [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Cooldown Cat]] and [[Cat Gunslinger (Rare Cat)|Cat Eastwood]] are recommended, and you could bring in an anti-Dark [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber]] if you have one. Bringing ranged attackers to counter the Mooths is not necessary as they tend to die quickly. Any [[:Category:Crowd-Controller-class Cats|Crowd-Control]] Ubers you may have are handy for stopping the Shadow Boxer Ks. If you have her, [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Ring Girl Cat]] is a great attacker for the Shadow Boxer Ks; if you don't have any anti-Dark Cats, high-DPS cats like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] can kill the Shadow Boxer Ks quickly.

Shadow Boxer Ks only spawn after ~30 seconds and not when you hit the base, so you can just simply rush the stage by killing the Mooths with cats such as [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Butterfly Cat]] and defeat the base within 30 seconds.

==='''Chapter 2 '''===
Same as Chapter 1's strategy, but use some more damage-dealers like Ring Girl Cat or [[Figure Skating Cats (Super Rare Cat)|Drama Cats]] to get a lot of hits in for the SBKs, as they rush faster and plow through your meatshields faster.

==='''Chapter 3'''===
Use the Mooths to build up your money in the beginning. [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Sexy Legs Cat]] does a good job with killing them, along with some tanky units. Fast damage-dealers like Paris Cat, Drama Cats, and [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Holy Valkyrie]] are almost a necessity. For Le'noir, you can either use tanky attackers, or get in some quick hits with [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Lion Cat]]/[[Crazed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Giraffe]], etc. Cats that outrange Le'noir and are anti-Dark would be extremely helpful. Ubers like Sanada Yukimura, when timed correctly, can ensure a high timed score.

